386	/* ══ The rest of the app ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
387	   This redesign covers the VPS panel; ~18 other files across Settings,
388	   Support, Directory, Migrate, Services and the game panel (which the VPS
389	   panel's own look was modelled on) use the SAME hand-written idiom: a card
390	   is `bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,22,48,N),rgba(2,7,20,N))]` with a
391	   `text-white` heading inside it, tuned only ever against a dark page. Editing
